  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0: Split out of the Caveman package — the Semantic Kernel plugins (TokenOptimizerPlugin, CavemanServicesPlugin, CavemanWikiPlugin, CavemanConversationPlugin) now live here so the core Caveman package no longer forces a SemanticKernel dependency. New CavemanConversationPlugin exposes conversation/agent tools (summarize_conversation, fit_to_budget, extract_memory, focus_conversation, estimate_tokens).",
